        341.31,
        88.97,
        341.31
      ],
      "text": "The Directorate of Education, Government of NCT of Delhi, is pleased to announce the organisation of various student-centric activities under “Sewa Sankalp Abhiyan”, with the objective of providing students an opportunity to express their ideas, creativity and aspirations relating to public service, development, nation-building and the vision of “Viksit Bharat @2047”. The Abhiyan seeks to highlight the journey of public service over the past 25 years and create awareness among students regarding various welfare and development initiatives."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        88.97,
        345.87,
        503.39,
        345.87,
        503.39,
        378.76,
        88.97,
        378.76
      ],
      "text": "Accordingly, all Heads of Government Schools of NCT of Delhi are directed to ensure active participation of students in the following competitions:"
